  ('services_retail', 5, 'Local services and retail', 'स्थानीय सेवाएँ और खुदरा व्यापार', 'स्थानिक सेवा आणि किरकोळ व्यापार', 'Shops, wholesale, online selling, street vending, salons, laundry, repairs, transport, homestays, clinics, coaching, contracting and other local services.', false),
